📌 What is Dynamic Programming (DP)?

**Dynamic Programming (DP)** is a method used to:

👉 Solve complex problems by breaking them into smaller subproblems

---

🎯 Key Idea

```text id="dp1"
Solve → Store → Reuse
```

---

🧠 Why DP in Reinforcement Learning?

DP helps in:

✔ Finding optimal policy
✔ Solving MDPs efficiently
✔ Computing value functions

---

📊 Requirements for DP

To apply DP, we need:

✔ Full knowledge of environment
✔ Transition probabilities
✔ Reward function

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔑 Key Concepts

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1️⃣ Value Function

[
V(s)
]

Expected reward from state.

---

2️⃣ Policy (π)

Strategy mapping:

```text id="dp2"
State → Action
```

---

3️⃣ Bellman Equation

```text id="dp3"
Value = Reward + Future Value
```

---

🔥 Types of DP Methods

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔵 1️⃣ Value Iteration

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

📌 What is Value Iteration?

It directly computes:

👉 Optimal value function

Then derives policy.

---

🔄 Steps

```text id="vi1"
Initialize V(s)
      ↓
Update using Bellman Equation
      ↓
Repeat until convergence
```

---

📊 Formula

[
V(s) = \max_a [R(s,a) + γ \sum P(s'|s,a)V(s')]
]

---

🧠 Key Idea

👉 Always choose best action

---

✅ Advantages

✔ Simple to implement
✔ Faster convergence

---

❌ Disadvantages

❌ No explicit policy until end

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🟢 2️⃣ Policy Iteration

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

📌 What is Policy Iteration?

It improves policy step-by-step.

---

🔄 Steps

```text id="pi1"
Initialize Policy
      ↓
Policy Evaluation
      ↓
Policy Improvement
      ↓
Repeat until optimal
```

---

📊 Policy Evaluation

[
V(s) = R(s,a) + γ \sum P(s'|s,a)V(s')
]

---

📊 Policy Improvement

```text id="pi2"
Choose action that maximizes value
```

---

🧠 Key Idea

👉 Improve policy gradually

---

✅ Advantages

✔ More stable
✔ Clear policy updates

---

❌ Disadvantages

❌ Slower than value iteration

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

⚖️ Value Iteration vs Policy Iteration

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

📊 Comparison Table

| Feature    | Value Iteration | Policy Iteration     |
| ---------- | --------------- | -------------------- |
| Approach   | Value-based     | Policy-based         |
| Steps      | Single loop     | Two-step loop        |
| Speed      | Faster          | Slower               |
| Complexity | Lower           | Higher               |
| Policy     | Derived later   | Updated continuously |

