🧠 When to Use What?

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Use Value Iteration When:

✔ Faster solution needed
✔ Smaller state space

---

Use Policy Iteration When:

✔ Need stable policy
✔ Clear improvement steps

---

📊 Applications

* Game AI
* Robotics
* Navigation systems
* Resource optimization

